  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 903.02 Inspection Reports",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 903.02 Inspection Reports. Upon conducting an investigation or an inspection, the department shall:\n\n(a) Make a report that includes a listing of the violations found during the inspection, if any;\n\n(b) Maintain the report on file at the department; and\n\n(c) Provide a copy of the report to the owner or operator or the owner’s or operator’s agent, if requested, upon completion of the final inspection report.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12351, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14283, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
